The method-of-moments estimators are
\deqn{\hat{\alpha} = \frac{R_1 (R_2 - R_1)}{2 R_1 - R_1^2 - R_2}, \qquad
\hat{\beta} = \frac{\hat{\alpha} (1 - R_1)}{R_1}.}
